# What this module is

BlockAds is an open-source, on-device ad-blocking application for Android.
The app allows users to filter network traffic via a local VPN tunnel or Root proxy, block tracking domains, inspect DNS logs, manage custom filter rules, and browse the web with an ad-free in-app browser supporting background video playback.

## Audience & tone

Direct, clear, concise for mobile UI navigation bars and setting screens.
- `vi` uses "bạn", not "quý khách".
- `de` uses standard UI tone (direct infinitive or "Sie").

## Do not translate

- BlockAds
- VPN
- DNS

## Glossary

| term | locale | translation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| browser | vi | Trình duyệt |
| browser | zh | 浏览器 |

## Notes per locale

- `ar` — RTL, and CLDR wants all six plural quantities
- `in` — Android's legacy code for Indonesian — never write `id` in the CSV
- `iw` — Android's legacy code for Hebrew — never write `he`
- `pt-BR` — Brazilian Portuguese
- `zh` — Simplified Chinese
